Or, perhaps, a blessed magic marker (which you could almost certainly
use to write enough b?enchant weapon and b?enchant armor to equal
those increase damage/accuracy numbers and vastly exceed the ring of
protection).  And it wouldn't hurt your spellcasting!

Electric shock is completely avoidable as long as you excercise care
near water and aren't stupid with chests (presumably you have
reflection if you're considering such a wish--if not, that's clearly
superior!)

